msgstr ""

msgid "Receivers can also be registered programmatically at runtime via the `Receivers` interface:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Use the fluent builder API to define and register a receiver:"
msgstr ""

msgid "The `Registration` handle can be used to unregister the receiver later:"
msgstr ""

